---@field AlarmActions? aws.cloudwatch.ResourceList The actions to execute when this alarm transitions to the ALARM state from any other state. Each action is specified as an Amazon Resource Name (ARN).
---@field InsufficientDataActions? aws.cloudwatch.ResourceList The actions to execute when this alarm transitions to the INSUFFICIENT_DATA state from any other state. Each action is specified as an Amazon Resource Name (ARN).
