---@field QueryResultsToEvaluate? aws.cloudwatch.QueryResultsToEvaluate The number of most recent scheduled query results that the alarm evaluates against the threshold (the N in M-of-N evaluation).
---@field QueryResultsToAlarm? aws.cloudwatch.QueryResultsToAlarm The number of query results, out of the most recent QueryResultsToEvaluate results, that must breach the threshold to trigger the alarm to transition to ALARM (the M in M-of-N evaluation).
